<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Dec '96 oil output rises to 85,000 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Dec '96 oil output rises to 85,000 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office</p>
<p>reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV CRUDE PETROLEUM	    DEC 96	NOV 96	DEC 95</p>
<p> crude petroleum (tonnes)	     85,000     83,000	 87,000</p>
<p> natural gas (million cu.meters)     60	   60	     86</p>
<p>NOTE -- Data refer to Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro. -- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 222 4305</p>
</text>
